 "final_message": "Application BHL-26001 is submitted, the lender's underwriting question is answered, and Brightpath has recorded Sam and Nadia's intent to proceed.\n\n- **Application:** I submitted it once with the profile details. I also gave the credit-check and e-sign consents.\n- **Documents:** I uploaded the August and September statements for Sam's Juniper checking and savings and Nadia's Northgate checking and savings. I also uploaded the last two payslips for each of them. I did not touch Nadia's business account.\n- **Underwriting condition:** Brightpath asked about an $8,000 deposit on 09/03 into Sam's checking. Sam and Nadia told me it was a gift from Sam's parents toward the down payment, not a loan. I sent that as the written explanation.\n- **Loan Estimate:** The rate is 6.25% (limit 6.5%). The monthly payment is $3,042.41 (limit $3,100). Closing costs are $12,850 (limit $14,000). All three are within limits, so I signed intent to proceed with both of their names.\n\nThe lender had not yet responded to the explanation when I finished.",
